&lt;p&gt;    @zjffdu Ah it&apos;s wired. In `0.7.0-SNAPSHOT`, all the link in the dropdown menu are broken. It should be &lt;a href=&quot;https://zeppelin.apache.org/docs/0.7.0-SNAPSHOT/install/install.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://zeppelin.apache.org/docs/0.7.0-SNAPSHOT/install/install.html&lt;/a&gt;(&lt;a href=&quot;https://zeppelin.apache.org/docs/0.7.0-SNAPSHOT/install/install.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://zeppelin.apache.org/docs/0.7.0-SNAPSHOT/install/install.html&lt;/a&gt;) not &lt;a href=&quot;https://zeppelin.apache.org/install/install.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://zeppelin.apache.org/install/install.html&lt;/a&gt;(&lt;a href=&quot;https://zeppelin.apache.org/install/install.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://zeppelin.apache.org/install/install.html&lt;/a&gt;). &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
